<title>ESTONIA: RAKVERE CAPITAL CUT IN EFFECT ON MARCH 24.</title>
<headline>RAKVERE CAPITAL CUT IN EFFECT ON MARCH 24.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Rakvere meat company said that a 10 percent decrease in its share capital comes into effect on March 24.</p>
<p>The stock exchange said in a statement that from today all share trade in Rakevere will be based on the share capital reduction of 10 percent.</p>
<p>Rakvere is to reduce its share capital by swapping each one share for 0.9 of a share, a stock exchange official said.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
